{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8b584d0b-689b-449e-ba23-1d01f9bbd5f1",
    "name": "SoftPOS Tap-to-Phone API",
    "description": "Colección completa para realizar pruebas de extremo a extremo del microservicio Core de Tap-to-Phone. Incluye atestación remota MPoC y transacciones con validación Luhn y cifrado FPE.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. MPoC Device Attestation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verify Device (Trusted)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"terminalId\": \"TRM00001\",\n  \"deviceHardwareId\": \"ARM64-SECURE-CHIP-99A82D\",\n  \"hceToken\": \"SECURE_HCE_TOKEN_EXP_2026\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/attestation/verify",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "attestation",
                "verify"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envía los identificadores de hardware y tokens NFC del terminal móvil para realizar la atestación MPoC remota y validar el nivel de confianza (TRUSTED)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Core Transactions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Process Transaction (Approved - Valid Luhn)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pan\": \"4111112222213333\",\n  \"amount\": 150.00,\n  \"currency\": \"840\",\n  \"merchantId\": \"MERCH0000000001\",\n  \"terminalId\": \"TRM00001\",\n  \"stan\": \"000101\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions/process",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "transactions",
                "process"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Procesa un pago exitoso con tarjeta utilizando una PAN real con verificación matemática de Luhn válida. Aplica FPE sobre los dígitos centrales y persiste en base de datos."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Process Transaction (Declined - Invalid Luhn)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pan\": \"4111112222223333\",\n  \"amount\": 250.00,\n  \"currency\": \"840\",\n  \"merchantId\": \"MERCH0000000001\",\n  \"terminalId\": \"TRM00001\",\n  \"stan\": \"000102\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions/process",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "transactions",
                "process"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de error al ingresar una tarjeta que NO pasa la validación Luhn. Retorna código de respuesta '14' (Tarjeta Inválida) inmediatamente sin procesar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Process Transaction (Declined - Exceeds Tap Limit)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pan\": \"4111112222213333\",\n  \"amount\": 15000.00,\n  \"currency\": \"840\",\n  \"merchantId\": \"MERCH0000000001\",\n  \"terminalId\": \"TRM00001\",\n  \"stan\": \"000103\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions/process",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "transactions",
                "process"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de rechazo de negocio. El monto excede el límite permitido para pagos Tap sin contacto de una sola exhibición ($10,000). Retorna código de respuesta '61' (Supera límite)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Transactions (Masked PANs)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "transactions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta el historial seguro de transacciones. Retorna el listado completo demostrando que los PANs reales nunca se exponen (retorna en formato enmascarado '411111******3333')."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Transaction By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/transactions/e15c4d32-cd2b-426b-88a2-f81d11ff9288",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "transactions",
                "e15c4d32-cd2b-426b-88a2-f81d11ff9288"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta un registro transaccional específico utilizando su ID (UUID) único."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
